Word selection and frequency ranks are derived from FrequencyWords by Hermit
Dave (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords, content/2018/es/es_50k.txt,
OpenSubtitles; content CC BY-SA 4.0, code MIT). Translations and examples are
authored for Lorito and are part of this CC BY-SA 4.0 dataset. Nothing outside
this folder is generated from the list (the conjugation trainer's verb ranks in
content/conjugation/ are credited separately under the same terms).
